:part-1","annotationId":"0009","glossId":"0009-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/073-da-che/quwanli-quanshi/0009-1","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi","materialTitle":"詩經詮釋","contributorLine":"现代 · 屈萬里","publicationYear":1983,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"穀則異室","sourceLabel":"第 89 页","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注釋","excerpt":"穀，生也。","fullText":"穀，生也。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-009"]},{"id":"quwanli-quanshi:0010-1:part-1","annotationId":"0010","glossId":"0010-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/073-da-che/quwanli-quanshi/0010-1","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi","materialTitle":"詩經詮釋","contributorLine":"现代 · 屈萬里","publicationYear":1983,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"死則同穴","sourceLabel":"第 89 页","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注釋","excerpt":"穴，墓穴也。此句乃願望之辭。","fullText":"穴，墓穴也。此句乃願望之辭。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-010"]},{"id":"quwanli-quanshi:0011-1:part-1","annotationId":"0011","glossId":"0011-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/073-da-che/quwanli-quanshi/0011-1","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi","materialTitle":"詩經詮釋","contributorLine":"现代 · 屈萬里","publicationYear":1983,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"有如皦日","sourceLabel":"第 89 页","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注釋","excerpt":"皦，音皎，白也，明也。","fullText":"皦，音皎，白也，明也。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-012"]},{"id":"wangli-yundu:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/073-da-che/wangli-yundu/0001-1","materialId":"wangli-yundu","materialTitle":"詩經韻讀","contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","publicationYear":1980,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"大车槛槛，毳衣如菼。当不尔思？畏子不敢。","sourceLabel":"第 180-181 页","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","excerpt":"大车槛槛(heam)，毳衣如菼(tham)。当不尔思? 畏子不敢(kam)。（谈部）","fullText":"大车槛槛(heam)，毳衣如菼(tham)。当不尔思? 畏子不敢(kam)。（谈部）","notes":"据页图转写，保留拟音